LaunchStack scenario graph service
==================================

This service bundles and uses the following third-party software.

Graphiti (graphiti-core 0.31.2)
  Copyright 2024, Zep Software, Inc.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  https://github.com/getzep/graphiti
  You may obtain a copy of the License at
  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  Graphiti is installed unmodified from PyPI into this service's image. The
  service calls its public API (Graphiti, add_episode, search_, EpisodicNode,
  OpenAIGenericClient, OpenAIEmbedder) and subclasses two of its clients
  (app/backend.py); it does not change Graphiti's source.

Neo4j Community Edition (neo4j:5.26-community)
  Copyright (c) Neo4j Sweden AB.
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 (GPLv3).
  https://neo4j.com/licensing/
  Neo4j is NOT included in this service's image and is not redistributed by
  this project. It runs as a separate, unmodified container from the official
  `neo4j` image (docker-compose.yml, profile `scenarios-graph`), and this
  service talks to it over the network with the Bolt protocol through the
  Apache-2.0 licensed Neo4j Python driver.

Neo4j Python driver (neo4j 6.4.1)
  Copyright (c) Neo4j Sweden AB.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Other Python dependencies (FastAPI, Starlette, Uvicorn, Pydantic, OpenAI
Python SDK, and their transitive dependencies pinned in requirements.txt) are
installed unmodified under their own licenses: MIT, BSD-3-Clause or
Apache-2.0, numpy under BSD-3-Clause with bundled permissive components, and
certifi under MPL-2.0.
